{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道行动还不够，却舍不得松手，连承认失望都像是在推翻那一步。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动还不够\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"想到那种不必防备的亲近，他心里会软，可又怕自己一软下来就停了步。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里会软\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他把难受和想停都当成自己还不够坚定，便逼自己继续撑。\",\n      \"key\": \"还不够坚定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他连累了也不准自己松劲，直到发现自己正逼着一个累了的人硬撑，终于不想再证明自己多坚强。\",\n      \"key\": \"不准自己松劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他有些茫然，撑着的劲松了，却没因此安心，才肯承认自己仍舍不得那种不必防备的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确保留行动仍不够，同时保留他舍不得松手、怕承认失望等于推翻当初决定的心理。跨段箭头改指S04-1，由那一步确实帮他走出犹疑解释他为何不肯放手。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留上一轮已补入的亲近感与停步之忧，解释柔和私语感为何出现，又为何与向前的压力并存。不把B5的备选听法写成真实经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"收紧\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把受苦误认成自己不够坚定、因此继续逼迫自己的机制；不再重复S05-1已经表达的舍不得放手。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\", \"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补明\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不容许疲惫的硬性要求如何发展成自我苛责，也保留他看见自己正在逼迫一个累了的人硬撑的转折。明确补回他终于不想再证明自己坚强。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\", \"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留松开催逼后仍未安心、依恋才得以浮现的过程。将‘生活’改为前文明确出现的‘不必防备的亲近’，不把珠子中的另一种听法当成事实。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1b66540c-31f2-4189-88fc-582a3c2f43ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T191709596546Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.484, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:21:52.098563+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b12f928f3e1ac5ff3494f8150fee11adee8ddc6bfe599ca03a34f4f4360572b0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "scr